WEBVTT

00:49.226 --> 00:52.211
Hmm.

01:17.380 --> 01:30.513
Oh.

01:30.633 --> 01:30.793
Oh.

01:54.950 --> 01:55.050
Yeah.

02:21.487 --> 02:28.089
We left the atmosphere, the world was grey The

02:28.149 --> 02:33.491
heavy gravity has finally faded away We were

02:33.551 --> 02:38.313
living in a room with the curtains drawn tight

02:40.194 --> 02:44.095
But out here in the void, there is only the light

02:46.336 --> 02:50.538
The terrestrial sounds are just a buzz in the ear

02:53.569 --> 02:59.491
A static station that we no longer hear The

02:59.611 --> 03:08.753
silence is turning into a song This is the orbit

03:08.773 --> 03:15.546
where we belong And we are seeing The true

03:15.606 --> 03:21.910
spectrum A billion stars burning Ultraviolet

03:21.990 --> 03:29.573
and blue Dancing in the dust of a cosmic summer

03:30.694 --> 03:35.996
The nebula Is splitting the dark in two This is

03:36.056 --> 03:38.898
the electric color

03:41.923 --> 03:44.985
The universe waking up for you

04:15.572 --> 04:23.296
They wanted a painted sky A plastic sun A little

04:23.356 --> 04:29.439
radio hit when the day was done But you cannot

04:29.499 --> 04:36.062
capture the burning of a star When you keep the

04:36.182 --> 04:39.324
engine locked inside a jar

04:42.045 --> 04:44.887
Recharging the coordinates they couldn't see

04:48.855 --> 04:54.780
Out here in the quiet of the zero G The

04:54.840 --> 04:59.203
terrestrial sounds are just a buzz in the ear

05:01.846 --> 05:07.870
A static station that we no longer hear The

05:07.951 --> 05:13.135
silence is turning into a song

05:19.579 --> 05:27.062
And we are seeing the true spectrum A billion

05:27.122 --> 05:33.385
stars burning ultraviolet and blue Dancing in

05:33.425 --> 05:40.467
the dust of a cosmic summer The nebula is

05:41.468 --> 05:46.250
splitting the dark in two This is the electric

05:46.450 --> 05:46.990
color

05:50.204 --> 05:55.286
The universe waking up for you.

06:23.947 --> 06:23.967
♪

07:02.350 --> 07:05.231
The true spectrum

07:08.573 --> 07:10.674
Ultraviolet and blue

07:14.356 --> 07:16.738
We finally found the color

07:26.641 --> 07:27.222
so so

